    "created_at": "2020-02-12T17:37:32Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-02-12T17:37:32Z",
    "body": "Hmm. This seems pretty bad to me; the intention is not to ever upgrade disconnected elements unless one explicitly uses `customElements.upgrade()`. How did we get this wrong when writing tests? Is it too late to fix browsers?\r\n\r\n/cc @mfreed7 (who I just invited to @whatwg/components).",
